NovaVision Image Stack

This package implements behavior equivalent to the Roboflow Image Stack
workflow block. The public behavior and design were informed by the Roboflow
Inference documentation and reference implementation:

https://inference.roboflow.com/workflows/blocks/image_stack/
https://github.com/roboflow/inference/blob/main/inference/core/workflows/core_steps/fusion/image_stack/v1.py

